 "source_rationale": "NISTu230 cwt (US) root_units NISTu203 (cwt UK, power 1) -> hecto NISTu201 (lb): 1 cwt (US) = 100 lb per its UnitsDB name. NISTu73 kp root_units NISTu196 (gf) gains kilo prefix: 1 kp = 1000 gf = 1 kgf, mirroring NISTu72. NISTu196 gf: self-referential root_units (1 gf = 1000 gf) removed; canonical_conversion to NISTu11 newton, factor 0.00980665 (1 gf = 9.80665 mN; NPL; NIST SP 811 B.9), as bar -> pascal.",
